%% Mermaid diagram describing the QuestBoard layered architecture
graph TD
    Client[Client Apps / Frontend] --> API[QuestBoard.Api]
    API --> Application[QuestBoard.Application]
    Application --> Domain[QuestBoard.Domain]
    Application --> Infrastructure[QuestBoard.Infrastructure]
    Infrastructure --> Persistence[(EF Core / SQLite or SQL Server)]
    Infrastructure --> Auth[JWT Token Service]
    Infrastructure --> Files[Local File Storage]
    Infrastructure --> Email[SmtpEmailSender]
    Infrastructure --> BackgroundJobs[EmailBackgroundService]
